"{\"action\": \"final\", \"answer\": \"To claim travel expenses for a business trip to London, follow these steps: \\n1. Book flights within the specified class (Premium economy class for international short-haul flights).\\n2. Reasonable costs associated with ground transportation will be reimbursed.\\n3. For accommodation, since London is considered a high-cost city, you can claim expenses beyond the USD 150 nightly cap. However, the exact amount should be within the per diem rates found in the Expense Policy Manual available on our internal portal.\\n4. Submit your claim with receipts for any expenses exceeding USD 100.\", \"sources\": [\"expenses.pdf\"]}"